   3.3906070290104*^9},ExpressionUUID->"578c3f37-3f90-41ac-a2eb-0983360ad9fc"],

Cell["?Sin", "Input",ExpressionUUID->"14bdff0c-a05a-492e-8982-445d3b0ca0e2"],

Cell["?sin", "Input",ExpressionUUID->"386e90b8-e57c-4634-af2f-224be25a77eb"],

Cell["\<\
Sin is the built-in sine function, so ?Sin shows its usage message and a \
documentation link. sin with a small s is not a Mathematica name at all, just \
an undefined symbol, so ?sin shows no value. Every built-in name begins with \
a capital letter.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"fd7a6a2d-920d-4a94-8e9f-87daa2628939"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["5:",
  FontSize->16,
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " Insert your answers to the following questions by inserting new Input \
Cells immediately below this Text Cell.\n\n\tEnter the ",
 StyleBox["Mathematica",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " code which accomplishes the following:\n\n\[GrayCircle]\t",
 StyleBox["Clear[ a, A, feet, sec ];",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 "\n \tEvaluate ",
 StyleBox["a/A",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 "\n \t(Use one Input cell for both lines and be sure to use the \"",
 StyleBox[";",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 "\") \t\n\[GrayCircle] \tCheck the values assigned to both:  ",
 StyleBox["a",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 "  and:  ",
 StyleBox["A",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 "\n\[GrayCircle]\tAssign:    ",
 StyleBox["5 feet / sec",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 "     to:   ",
 StyleBox["A",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 "\n\t(i.e.   ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["A",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], " ", "=", " ", 
    RowBox[{"5", " ", 
     RowBox[{"feet", "/", "sec"}]}]}], TraditionalForm]],
  FontWeight->"Bold",ExpressionUUID->"06bb7747-f5b9-49a2-a462-2ebaf0571cb1"],
 ")\n\[GrayCircle]\tEvaluate   ",
 StyleBox["a/A",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 "\n\[GrayCircle]\tCheck the values assigned to both:  ",
 StyleBox["a",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 "  and:  ",
 StyleBox["A",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 "\n\[GrayCircle]\tAssign:       ",
 StyleBox["10 feet",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 "      to:    ",
 StyleBox["a",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 "\n\[GrayCircle]\tEvaluate ",
 StyleBox["a/A",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 "\n\[GrayCircle]\tCheck the values assigned to both:  ",
 StyleBox["a",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 "  and:  ",
 StyleBox["A",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 "\n\[GrayCircle]\tCheck the values assigned to both:   ",
 StyleBox["feet",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 "   and:   ",
 StyleBox["sec",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 "\n\[GrayCircle]\tExplain the results (in a ",
 StyleBox["Text",
  FontVariations->{"Underline"->True}],
 " Cell).\n"
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.3903443822374*^9, 3.3903445092153997`*^9}, {
   3.3903445436303997`*^9, 3.3903445926823997`*^9}, {3.3903446537594*^9, 
